From: swee <2385455860@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 17:37:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: match TS-Reasoner two-stage training recipe

---
 README.md                                   | 35 +++++++++++++++++++--
 data/dataset_info.ts_reasoner.json          | 18 +++++++++++
 scripts/full/train_timesfm2_5_stage1.sh     | 17 +++++-----
 scripts/full/train_timesfm2_5_stage2.sh     | 20 ++++++------
 src/llamafactory/hparams/finetuning_args.py |  6 ++--
 5 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/dataset_info.ts_reasoner.json

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index bdc33ea..406532f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -43,10 +43,13 @@ Then add the following options to a normal ChatTS training command:
 
 ```bash
 --ts_encoder_type timesfm2_5 \
---timesfm_model_name_or_path google/timesfm-2.5-200m-pytorch \
---timeseries_sft_lr 1e-4
+--timesfm_model_name_or_path google/timesfm-2.5-200m-pytorch
 ```
 
+`--timeseries_sft_lr` is optional. When set with this adapter it changes the learning rate of the
+two-layer TS-to-text projector only; it never unfreezes or updates TimesFM. Omit it to use the same
+learning rate for the LLM and projector, as in the published TS-Reasoner recipe.
+
 Runnable templates are provided in
 [`scripts/full/train_timesfm2_5_stage1.sh`](scripts/full/train_timesfm2_5_stage1.sh) and
 [`scripts/full/train_timesfm2_5_stage2.sh`](scripts/full/train_timesfm2_5_stage2.sh).
@@ -54,6 +57,8 @@ Runnable templates are provided in
 Important behavior:
 
 - TimesFM stays frozen; only the projector and the parameters selected by the normal fine-tuning mode are optimized.
+- TS-Reasoner itself uses `finetuning_type=full` in both stages: the full LLM and projector are trainable in both
+  alignment and instruction tuning. It does not use a projector-only stage 1.
 - TimesFM uses 32-point patches instead of ChatTS' original 8-point patches, reducing time-series tokens by about 4x.
 - TimesFM weights remain an external dependency and are not copied into every ChatTS checkpoint.
 - Stage-1 checkpoints record `ts_encoder_type=timesfm2_5`; stage 2 can use `--ts_encoder_type auto`.
@@ -62,6 +67,32 @@ Important behavior:
 - Load trained checkpoints through this patched LLaMA-Factory loader; a plain upstream
   `AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(...)` does not know how to reconstruct the external TimesFM adapter.
 
+TS-Reasoner paper hyperparameters used by the provided templates:
+
+| Stage | Data | Trainable modules | Frozen module | Global batch | LR | Epochs |
+|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| 1 alignment | 120K captions | full LLM + projector | TimesFM | 64 | `1e-5` | 1 |
+| 2 instruction | 30K instructions | full LLM + projector | TimesFM | 32 | `2e-5` | 2 |
+
+The paper reports a global batch of 32 for stage 2. The current upstream TS-Reasoner shell script uses
+8 GPUs × batch 1 × accumulation 8 = 64 instead; these templates follow the paper's Table 4.
+
+Merge the entries from `data/dataset_info.ts_reasoner.json` into `data/dataset_info.json`
+before using the templates. The fragment contains:
+
+```json
+{
+  "stage_1_120K": {
+    "file_name": "data/alignment/align_120K.jsonl",
+    "columns": {"prompt": "input", "response": "output", "timeseries": "timeseries"}
+  },
+  "stage_2_30K": {
+    "file_name": "data/finetuning/sft-30K.jsonl",
+    "columns": {"prompt": "input", "response": "output", "timeseries": "timeseries"}
+  }
+}
+```
+
 
 ## Steps to reproduce
 1. Download the training datasets from [ChatTS-Training-Dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/ChatTSRepo/ChatTS-Training-Dataset). Put the folders under `data/` (e.g., `data/align_256/`, `data/align_random/`, etc).
